        <div class="col-md-12 text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold text-light">How It Works</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4">
            <div class="d-inline-flex border border-secondary rounded-circle p-4 mb-3 bg-dark">
                <i class="fas fa-mouse-pointer text-info fa-2x"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="text-light">1. Choose a Course</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary small">Pick from Web Dev, SQL, .NET & more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4">
            <div class="d-inline-flex border border-secondary rounded-circle p-4 mb-3 bg-dark">
                <i class="fas fa-book-reader text-warning fa-2x"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="text-light">2. Read & Understand</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary small">Absorb simple, text-based theories.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4">
            <div class="d-inline-flex border border-secondary rounded-circle p-4 mb-3 bg-dark">
                <i class="fas fa-code text-danger fa-2x"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="text-light">3. Practice Examples</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary small">Type out our rich code snippets.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4">
            <div class="d-inline-flex border border-secondary rounded-circle p-4 mb-3 bg-dark">
                <i class="fas fa-level-up-alt text-success fa-2x"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="text-light">4. Improve Skills</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary small">Level up your tech career.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- I. Achievements & Stats -->
    <div class="row text-center mb-5 py-5 rounded shadow" style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);">
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4 mb-md-0">
            <h2 class="display-4 fw-bold text-info">20+</h2>
            <p class="lead text-light mb-0">Premium Courses</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4 mb-md-0">
            <h2 class="display-4 fw-bold text-warning">5k+</h2>
            <p class="lead text-light mb-0">Active Users</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <h2 class="display-4 fw-bold text-success">150+</h2>
            <p class="lead text-light mb-0">Topics Covered</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- H. Admin / Team Section -->
    <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5 pb-4">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
             <div class="card bg-dark border-secondary shadow-lg">
                <div class="card-body p-5 text-center">
                    <img src="~/images/admin-profile.png" alt="Dipak Chande" class="rounded-circle mb-4 border border-3 border-info shadow" style="width: 150px; height: 150px; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold text-light">Dipak Chande</h3>
                    <h6 class="text-info mb-4">Platform Administrator / Developer</h6>
                    <p class="text-secondary fs-5 mb-4 px-md-4">
                        "I am deeply passionate about teaching coding in the absolute simplest way possible. I built this platform to give learners a fast, reliable, and distraction-free environment to master software development."
                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
                        <a href="https://github.com/dipak921" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-light"><i class="fab fa-github me-2"></i> GitHub</a>
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dipak-chande/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-info"><i class="fab fa-linkedin me-2"></i> LinkedIn</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- J. Testimonials -->
    <div class="row mb-5 pb-5">
        <div class="col-md-12 text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold text-light">What Our Learners Say</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-sm h-100" style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8;">
                <p class="text-secondary fst-italic mb-3">"This platform is exactly what I needed. Skipping 20-minute videos and just reading the exact code examples I need has accelerated my C# learning tremendously."</p>
                <h6 class="text-light fw-bold m-0">- Rahul S.</h6>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-sm h-100" style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border-left: 4px solid #facc15;">
                <p class="text-secondary fst-italic mb-3">"The SQL Server guide was a lifesaver. Simple text, no distractions, and beautifully formatted dark mode. Dipak has done a wonderful job!"</p>
                <h6 class="text-light fw-bold m-0">- Priya K.</h6>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- K. Call to Action & L. Contact Section -->
